`verilator_config
// Lint waivers for the RegisterBlock register-type blocks (ts/test/test_RegisterBlock_types.ts),
// used by `make regblock_types_sim`. Every waiver names one signal, and the open bug that owns it.
// The register types themselves (TSSV#80) need none. Delete a line when its bug is fixed.

// TSSV emits the Memory interface's definition into each block's file, ahead of the module.
lint_off -rule DECLFILENAME -file "*/RegisterBlock_types/regblock_types*.sv" -match "*IFACE name: 'memory_*"
